CODEGEN.md §4.4, decision 180, DECISIONS 278: gen/ts has no type for a define record, so a ts emit in any mode refuses one in a type or a value it writes, as baked go does, from check, not a crash of the build.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A rule.
record Rule {
  /// Its define.
  it: Define
}

/// Kinds.
let kinds: [Define] keyed by value = [{ value: 3 }]

emit ts { out: "@features/a/a.ts" }
